<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Legal Billing & Time Tracker' }) %>
<style>
  /* ── Hero ── */
  .hero { padding: 60px 0 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px; background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15); color: var(--accent2);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--accent2); }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .trust-line {
    font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 28px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  }
  .trust-line::before {
    content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px;
    background: #4ade80; border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .cta-group { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cta-primary {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    background: var(--accent); color: #fff;
    padding: 11px 22px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none; transition: opacity .15s;
  }
  .cta-primary:hover { opacity: .88; text-decoration: none; }
  .cta-secondary { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  .cta-secondary a { color: var(--muted); }
  .cta-secondary a:hover { color: var(--text); }

  /* ── Purpose block ── */
  .purpose {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px; margin: 40px 0;
  }
  .purpose p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; }

  /* ── Features ── */
  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin: 20px 0 0; }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;
  }
  .feature-icon { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .feature-card p { font-size: 13px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* ── Steps ── */
  .steps { counter-reset: step; margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .step {
    display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .step-num {
    counter-increment: step;
    width: 28px; height: 28px; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(99,102,241,0.18); color: var(--accent2);
    border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .step-num::before { content: counter(step); }
  .step-body h3 { font-size: 14px; margin: 3px 0 5px; }
  .step-body p  { font-size: 13px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* ── Compliance callout ── */
  .compliance {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); padding: 14px 18px;
    background: rgba(99,102,241,0.06); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin: 32px 0;
  }
  .compliance p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>
<main>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="badge">Claude Cowork Plugin &nbsp;·&nbsp; by Protomated</div>
    <h1>Never lose a billable<br>hour. <em>Never.</em></h1>
    <p style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:14px">Legal Billing &amp; Time Tracker</p>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Legal Billing &amp; Time Tracker lets you log hours, generate invoices, manage trust
      accounts, and review revenue — by chatting with Claude. Your data stays in a Google
      Sheet in your own Drive. We never touch your legal work.
    </p>
    <p class="trust-line">Free replacement for Clio and PracticePanther billing modules for solo attorneys</p>
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a class="cta-primary" href="https://protomated.com/templates/legal-billing-time-tracker/">
        Get the plugin ↗
      </a>
      <span class="cta-secondary">Free &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="#how-it-works">See how it works ↓</a></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="purpose">
    <p>
      <strong style="color:var(--text)">What this app does:</strong>
      Legal Billing &amp; Time Tracker connects Claude Cowork to your Google account to manage
      law firm billing records by chat. It uses the <strong style="color:var(--text)">Google Sheets API</strong>
      to read and write time entries, invoices, and trust account data to a spreadsheet in
      <strong style="color:var(--text)">your own Google Drive</strong>, and the
      <strong style="color:var(--text)">Google Drive API</strong> to create that spreadsheet on first use.
      Protomated stores only the OAuth tokens needed to write to your sheet — your billing data
      never passes through our servers.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>What you stop doing manually</h2>
  <div class="features">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">⏱</div>
      <h3>Log hours as they happen</h3>
      <p>"Log 1.5 hours for Garcia immigration matter at $400/hr" — written to your sheet before you forget.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">📄</div>
      <h3>Invoice in one command</h3>
      <p>Claude shows you unbilled entries, you confirm, it marks them as Billed and sets today's invoice date.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">🏦</div>
      <h3>Trust account records</h3>
      <p>Deposits and withdrawals with running balance auto-calculated. Safety check before every write.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
      <h3>Revenue at a glance</h3>
      <p>Total hours, fees billed, collected, and outstanding — pulled from your sheet whenever you ask.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>Install the plugin</h3>
        <p>
          Download the <code>.zip</code> from Protomated and upload it in
          Claude Cowork → Plugins → Add. Takes about 60 seconds.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>Connect Google once</h3>
        <p>
          Say "connect Google" in Claude. You'll see a sign-in page, authorize Sheets and Drive
          access, and you're done. Your Google account credentials are handled directly by Google
          — Protomated never sees your password.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>Set up your billing sheet</h3>
        <p>
          Claude will create a billing spreadsheet in your Google Drive from the Protomated
          template, or connect to one you already have. You own the file outright from creation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>Bill by chat</h3>
        <p>
          Log hours, run billing reviews, send invoices, record trust transactions — just by
          talking to Claude. No separate app to open, no tabs to switch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="compliance">
    <p>
      <strong style="color:var(--text)">Compliance-minded by design.</strong>
      Every trust account output carries a reminder to review against your state bar's
      trust-accounting rules. Every invoice output prompts you to review before sending.
      The plugin declines any request outside billing and time tracking —
      it never gives legal advice. ABA Model Rules and state bar compliance remain your responsibility.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Your data, your Drive</h2>
  <p>
    Your billing sheet lives in <strong style="color:var(--text)">your Google Drive</strong>,
    owned by you from day one. Protomated stores only the OAuth token that lets us write to it
    on your behalf, keyed to your Google account. You can disconnect or permanently delete your
    Protomated account at any time by telling Claude — no email required.
  </p>
  <p>
    Questions: <a href="mailto:dele@protomated.com">dele@protomated.com</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
    <a href="https://protomated.com">protomated.com</a>
  </p>

</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
